OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby inquiry about to
OL,4,Apublish report into hospital where
OL,5,Anurse murdered seven babies
OL,6,
OL,7,FA public inquiry into how Lucy Letby
OL,8,Fwas able to murder seven babies at the
OL,9,FCountess of Chester Hospital will
OL,10,Fpublish its findings at 12:30 BST -
OL,11,Fhere's a reminder of Letby's crimes
OL,13,FLetby, now 36, is serving 15 whole-life
OL,14,Fprison terms. She was convicted in 2023
OL,15,Fand has been denied permission to
OL,16,Fappeal against her convictions twice
OL,18,FThe Thirlwall Inquiry was commissioned
OL,19,Fby the government to explore how the
OL,20,Fhospital - where Letby worked as a
OL,21,Fneonatal nurse - handled concerns about
OL,22,Fher conduct
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
